description:
Yunzhihui Technology Company (Foxconn Group IT listed company) is recruiting for the India region:

IT Business Manager (stationed in India, returning every three months and staying for about a week)

Job Responsibilities:

1. As the main gateway for the company in India;

2. Responsible for developing and serving customers in the Indian region and striving for orders;

3. Responsible for building and managing a team in the India region;

4. Built in Bengaluru Bangarol;

5. Develop potential customers, expand the market, and achieve performance goals;

6. Regularly visit distribution customers to maintain stable customer relationships;

7. Responsible for domestic and international business negotiations and order processing;

8. Responsible for product quotation and product display, and handling matters related to account collection;

9. Responsible for business promotion, conveying and explaining major business messages, activities, and products of the company.

Job requirements:

1. Have an IT background;

2. Experience in business development, sales, Presale, or IT PM is preferred;

3. Proficient in both Chinese and English (basic oral and communication skills are required).

Welcome to WeChat communication: 18426436446, email: Christy.pan@maxnerva.com

Job Type: Full-time

Pay: ₹170,000.00 - ₹290,000.00 per month
